{"id":"world-2007-office2007","known":"2007-01-27","occurred":"2007-01-27","kind":"tech","stage":"effective","title":"Office 2007 becomes available","impact":"New Open XML formats (.xlsx, .docx) and Access .accdb arrive; a sheet grows from 65,536 rows x 256 columns to 1,048,576 x 16,384, so exports that split data at 65,536 rows or assume .xls break or become unnecessary; reading .xlsx or .accdb from code needs the ACE provider instead of Jet 4.0, and Office 2003 users need the Compatibility Pack to open the new files","industries":["*"],"areas":["platform"],"tech":{"product":"office","version":"2007","markers":[{"lang":"cs","name":"ACE OLE DB provider 12.0","pattern":"\\bMicrosoft\\.ACE\\.OLEDB\\.12\\.0\\b"},{"lang":"vb","name":"ACE OLE DB provider 12.0","pattern":"\\bMicrosoft\\.ACE\\.OLEDB\\.12\\.0\\b"},{"lang":"cs","name":"Excel 2007 extended properties","pattern":"(?i)Excel 12\\.0( Xml| Macro)?"},{"lang":"vb","name":"Excel 2007 extended properties","pattern":"(?i)Excel 12\\.0( Xml| Macro)?"},{"lang":"cs","name":"Office 2007 file extensions in strings","pattern":"(?i)\\.(xlsx|xlsm|xlsb|docx|accdb)\""},{"lang":"vb","name":"Office 2007 file extensions in strings","pattern":"(?i)\\.(xlsx|xlsm|xlsb|docx|accdb)\""},{"lang":"cs","name":"ACE ODBC drivers","pattern":"(?i)\\*\\.accdb\\)|\\*\\.xlsx"},{"lang":"vb","name":"ACE ODBC drivers","pattern":"(?i)\\*\\.accdb\\)|\\*\\.xlsx"},{"lang":"proj","name":"Office interop reference 12.0.0.0","pattern":"\\bMicrosoft\\.Office\\.Interop\\.(Excel|Word|Access|Outlook|PowerPoint),\\s*Version=12\\.0\\.0\\.0\\b"}]},"sources":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/lifecycle/products/microsoft-office-2007","https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/what-to-do-if-a-data-set-is-too-large-for-the-excel-grid-976e6a34-9756-48f4-828c-ca80b3d0e15c","https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/excel-specifications-and-limits-1672b34d-7043-467e-8e27-269d656771c3","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/archive/blogs/gray_knowlton/compatibility-pack-for-open-xml-20-million-downloads-and-counting","https://news.microsoft.com/2007/01/29/microsoft-launches-windows-vista-and-microsoft-office-2007-to-consumers-worldwide/"],"status":"verified","verified":{"on":"2026-10-30","by":"claude-code-cloud-verify-2"}}
